1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,960
So imagine the night Betelgeuse explodes.

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,180
The first sign would not be light

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:05,660
at all.

4
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:07,700
It would be a flood of ghostly

5
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:11,240
particles called neutrinos streaming out of the

6
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,260
collapsing core.

7
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,060
